// every nominee row. `honoree: true` flags the gold "2026 HONOREE"
// badge — currently Tony Orlando + Bob Anderson.
//
// Honorees NOT carried forward from the previous structure (cut):
//   Ilona Maher, Shedeur Sanders, Cooper Flagg.
